    "searchText": "foxwell enforcement careercontract orange level contract: destroy outlaw infrastructure foxwellenforcement_bombingrun_stanton_h foxwell enforcement careercontract standing pickup: stanton an opportunity has presented itself for a client to take action against a group of criminals who have been harassing their business.\n\naccording to reports, this group of outlaws are currently laying low at [location]. the client thinks this is a good time to catch them off guard and bring them to justice. the job is to take out their fuel tanks and putting an end to their smuggling operations once and for all.\n\nthese folks are not to be underestimated. you better bring some backup and fly low to avoid the turrets. priority as always is the fuel tanks.\n\ngood luck,\n\nkevin walton\ndispatcher, foxwell enforcement\n'security, your way'\n\nfoxwell enforcement is a bonded security specialist licensed to operate throughout the uee. we are always looking for new operators to join our family. if you or anyone you know is interested, please reach out to one of our contract representatives. orange level contract: take out fuel supplies red level contract: destroy outlaw infrastructure red level contract: fuel container demolition yellow level contract: disrupt operations yellow level contract: limiting potential threat 5365d562-a6c2-4bb4-af8e-346cf3430b62 54dcd780-5050-45be-85ec-fa983185abfc 2e13f91f-c78d-4160-bdb8-7d69cd43d652 f09d79bc-250a-4001-88ff-203b191ddbd2 3182e3b9-82f4-46a9-8479-b5496b51b852 6d43451e-c36b-4f9a-bc41-9ee6e3b8587f blueprint: foxwell enforcement generator: antium helmet jet, antium core maroon, antium legs maroon, antium helmet maroon +4 standing +200 credits formula unresolved standing +150 standing +300 standing +250 standing +100"
